# iTantra — Offline Multilingual Voice Communication

An Android app for offline voice communication over Wi-Fi and Bluetooth. Converts speech to compact text and back — no internet, no cloud.

**SIH Problem Statement ID:** SIH26173
**Team Name:** Team APEX
**Team ID:** 132

---

## Setup (5 minutes)

### 1. Clone the repository

    git clone https://github.com/omkar-jagtap8443/iTantra-SIH.git

### 2. Download Vosk language models

Due to GitHub's 100 MB file size limit, the STT models are not bundled in this repo. Download them separately from https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models

Required models:
- vosk-model-small-en-in-0.4 (English, Indian accent)
- vosk-model-small-hi-0.22 (Hindi)
- vosk-model-small-gu-0.42 (Gujarati)
- vosk-model-small-te-0.42 (Telugu)

Direct download links:
- https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models/vosk-model-small-en-in-0.4.zip
- https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models/vosk-model-small-hi-0.22.zip
- https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models/vosk-model-small-gu-0.42.zip
- https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models/vosk-model-small-te-0.42.zip

### 3. Extract the models

Extract each ZIP into app/src/main/assets/ so the structure becomes:

    app/src/main/assets/
    ├── vosk-model-small-en-in-0.4/
    ├── vosk-model-small-hi-0.22/
    ├── vosk-model-small-gu-0.42/
    └── vosk-model-small-te-0.42/

Each model folder must contain: am/, conf/, graph/, ivector/, uuid, README

### 4. Build and run

1. Open the project in Android Studio Hedgehog (2023.1.1) or newer
2. Wait for Gradle sync
3. Connect an Android phone (API 26+)
4. Click Run
5. Grant Microphone + Bluetooth permissions on first launch

---

## Features

- 100% offline — no internet required
- On-device STT (Vosk) — English, Hindi, Gujarati, Telugu
- On-device TTS
- TCP over Wi-Fi + Bluetooth RFCOMM
- Auto-discovery of nearby devices
- Save contacts, bidirectional messaging
- Priority emergency alerts (max volume)
- Offline cross-language translation (in development)

## Requirements

- Android Studio Hedgehog or newer
- Android device: API 26 (Android 8.0) or higher

